CACHE MANIFEST
# playzone offline cache v2 (2026-09-04) — fixed manifest
#
# v1 bug 1: hash comments were appended to URL lines ("index.html #sha").
# A '#' inside a URL line is parsed as a URL fragment, so every entry below
# it was invalid and the whole cache update failed. Comments must sit on
# their own line and start with '#'.
#
# v1 bug 2: the pages import chain_lapse.js?ui=3 / chain_poops.js?ui=3 and
# redirect to run_lapse.html?ui=3 / run_poops.html?ui=3, but the cache only
# listed the URLs WITHOUT "?ui=3". AppCache matches URLs exactly (query
# string included), so offline module imports always missed the cache.
#
# Note: chain_poops.js and mem.js import "core.js?v=10" while chain_lapse.js
# imports plain "core.js" — both exact specifiers are listed below.

CACHE:
index.html
run_lapse.html
run_poops.html
run_lapse.html?ui=3
run_poops.html?ui=3
chain_lapse.js?ui=3
chain_poops.js?ui=3
core.js
core.js?v=10
mem.js
int64.js
ps4_offsets.js
rpc_worker.js
logo_playzone.png
payload.bin
patches/1100.bin
patches/1150.bin
patches/1200.bin
patches/1250.bin
patches/1300.bin

NETWORK:
*

FALLBACK:
/ index.html
